Package: miadi-node
Version: 24.21.0-1
Section: interpreters
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libstdc++6 (>= 5.2), libgcc-s1
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: Node.js 24 LTS for Miadi's packages, private to them
 The Node.js release from nodejs.org (linux-x64), checked against its
 SHASUMS256.txt, at /usr/lib/miadi-node/bin/node. It runs the commands
 miadi-chronicle-client and miadi-chronicle-server install, so they need
 no Node on the host and never use the host's. Nothing goes on PATH: a
 system or nvm node is left as it is. No npm, npx or corepack.
